{
  "uid": "qc-investigacao",
  "title": "Investigação · Incidente",
  "description": "Do alerta ao log e do log ao trace: qual versão atendeu, quando mudou e qual requisição errou.",
  "tags": [
    "quantum-assistente",
    "demo-5.2"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "liveNow": false,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m"
    ]
  },
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "quantum-assistente"
      ],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "title": "Outras visões",
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "name": "Alertas disparando",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#F04E5E",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "expr": "max by (alertname, severity) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", severity=~\"warning|critical\"}) unless max by (alertname, severity) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", severity=~\"warning|critical\"} offset 10s)",
        "step": "10s",
        "titleFormat": "Alerta acendeu: {{alertname}}",
        "textFormat": "severidade {{severity}}",
        "useValueForTime": false,
        "hide": false
      },
      {
        "name": "Corpus trocado (reload)",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#ED145B",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "expr": "{service_name=\"quantum-assistant\"} |= \"runtime.reload\" | json",
        "instant": false,
        "titleFormat": "Corpus trocado",
        "textFormat": "corpus {{corpus_version}}",
        "tagKeys": "",
        "hide": false
      },
      {
        "name": "Falha injetada na API de pedidos",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#E9A23B",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "expr": "{service_name=\"quantum-orders-api\"} |~ \"orders.faults_(updated|reset)\" | json",
        "instant": false,
        "titleFormat": "{{event}}",
        "textFormat": "erro {{error_rate}} latencia {{latency_ms}} ms",
        "tagKeys": "",
        "hide": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "release",
        "label": "Release",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(answers_total, release_id)",
          "refId": "r"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(answers_total, release_id)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "corpus",
        "label": "Versão do corpus",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(answers_total, corpus_version)",
          "refId": "c"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(answers_total, corpus_version)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "scenario",
        "label": "Cenário",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(quality_probes_total, scenario)",
          "refId": "s"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(quality_probes_total, scenario)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "busca",
        "label": "Buscar no log (caso, motivo)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "trace_id",
        "label": "trace_id",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Como investigar",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "transparent": false,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "1. Escolha o **cenário** e a **versão do corpus** no topo. A tabela ao lado mostra quais versões atenderam no período.\n2. Na **linha do tempo**, veja quando o alerta acendeu. As marcas magenta são trocas de corpus; as âmbar, falhas injetadas na API de pedidos.\n3. Nos **logs**, procure `probe fail`. Clique na linha e depois em **Ver este trace (Jaeger) no painel**, ao lado do `trace_id`.\n4. O trace abre em tela cheia (ou na faixa *Trace da requisição escolhida*, abaixo dos logs). O span `rag.filter_documents` mostra o que foi bloqueado (ou deixou de ser).",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Versões que atenderam no período",
      "description": "Cada combinação de release e corpus que respondeu perguntas no intervalo escolhido. Um corpus novo no meio do período, com o mesmo release, é a pista de que o conteúdo mudou sem deploy de código.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (release_id, corpus_version, scenario) (increase(answers_total{job=\"quantum-assistant\", release_id=~\"$release\", corpus_version=~\"$corpus\"}[$__range])) > 0",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (release_id, corpus_version, scenario) (increase(quality_probes_total{outcome=\"fail\", release_id=~\"$release\", corpus_version=~\"$corpus\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "release_id": "Release",
              "corpus_version": "Versão do corpus",
              "scenario": "Cenário",
              "Value #A": "Perguntas",
              "Value #B": "Probes que erraram"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "release_id": 0,
              "corpus_version": 1,
              "scenario": 2,
              "Value #A": 3,
              "Value #B": 4
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Probes que erraram",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "0",
          "custom": {
            "align": "left",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Probes que erraram"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "#B4B1AD",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "#F04E5E",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "thresholds"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Versão do corpus"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5BC8D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Linha do tempo do incidente",
      "description": "Cada faixa é um alerta do Prometheus: colorida enquanto está disparando. As marcas verticais são eventos lidos dos logs (troca de corpus e falha injetada).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (alertname) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", alertname!=\"QualityNoData\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{alertname}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "10s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#F04E5E"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "disparando",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "Nenhum alerta no período"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "OrderApiDegraded"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#E9A23B"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "API de pedidos degradada"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "QualityProbeDegraded"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#E9A23B"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Probes abaixo de 90%"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "StaleSourceServed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#F04E5E"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Fonte obsoleta servida"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "QualityAclViolation"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#F04E5E"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Violação de ACL"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "rowHeight": 0.7,
        "mergeValues": true,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs do assistente, da API de pedidos e dos probes",
      "description": "Logs JSON lidos pelo OTel Collector de ops/.runtime/*.log e ops/results/*.jsonl e guardados no Loki. Clique numa linha e use 'Ver este trace (Jaeger) no painel'.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"quantum-assistant|quantum-orders-api|quantum-quality-probe\"} |= \"$busca\" | json | __error__=\"\" | drop severity, detected_level | label_format level=`{{ if eq .outcome \"fail\" }}error{{ else if eq .status_code \"503\" \"504\" }}warning{{ else }}info{{ end }}` | release_id=~\"$release\" | corpus_version=~\"$corpus\" | label_format scenario_id=`{{ or .scenario_id \"none\" }}` | scenario_id=~\"$scenario|none\" | line_format `{{ if .event }}{{ .event }}{{ else }}probe {{ .outcome }}{{ end }}{{ with .case_id }}  caso={{ . }}{{ end }}{{ with .route }}  rota={{ . }}{{ end }}{{ with .reason }}  motivo={{ . }}{{ end }}{{ with .abstain_reason }}  recusa={{ . }}{{ end }}{{ with .status_code }}  http={{ . }}{{ end }}{{ with .http_status }}  http={{ . }}{{ end }}{{ with .latency_ms }}  {{ . }} ms{{ end }}{{ with .corpus_version }}  corpus={{ . }}{{ end }}{{ with .scenario_id }}  cenario={{ . }}{{ end }}{{ with .trace_id }}  trace_id={{ . }}{{ end }}`",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "maxLines": 500
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "enableInfiniteScrolling": false,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "title": "Trace da requisição escolhida: clique num trace_id nos logs acima (ou cole no campo trace_id) e abra esta faixa",
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 50,
          "type": "traces",
          "title": "Trace da requisição escolhida",
          "description": "Cada etapa da requisição (rota, recuperação, filtro de documentos, composição, consulta de pedido) com o tempo de cada uma.",
          "gridPos": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 31,
            "w": 24,
            "h": 14
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "jaeger",
            "uid": "jaeger"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "datasource": {
                "type": "jaeger",
                "uid": "jaeger"
              },
              "query": "$trace_id",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "options": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Probes que erraram, por motivo",
      "description": "Quantos probes erraram por minuto, separados pelo motivo. Mostra o começo e o fim do incidente.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(quality_probes_total{outcome=\"fail\", scenario=~\"$scenario\", corpus_version=~\"$corpus\"}[1m])) > 0",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "range": true,
